---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import { resumeTimeline, coreTools } from '../data/resume';
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume | Kang Banseok Portfolio" description="강반석의 퍼포먼스/그로스/CRM 직무용 이력서 요약 페이지입니다.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Resume Summary</span>
      <h1>{profile.nameKo}</h1>
      <p>{profile.headline}</p>
      <div class="tag-list">
        {profile.targetRoles.map((role) => <span class="tag">{role}</span>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <article class="info-panel">
        <h2>Core Positioning</h2>
        <p>광고 영업형 퍼포먼스 마케터가 아니라, 인하우스에서 광고비와 전환 지표를 보고 성과 개선 액션을 설계하는 퍼포먼스/그로스 마케터를 지향합니다.</p>
        <blockquote>{profile.oneLineIntro}</blockquote>
      </article>
      <article class="info-panel">
        <h2>Core Tools</h2>
        <div class="tag-list">
          {coreTools.map((tool) => <span class="tag">{tool}</span>)}
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Experience Narrative</span>
          <h2>직무 연결 중심 경력 요약</h2>
          <p>퍼포먼스/그로스/CRM 직무와 연결되는 경험을 전면에 배치했습니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        {resumeTimeline.map((entry) => (
          <article class="timeline-item">
            <span>{entry.category} · {entry.period}</span>
            <h3>{entry.title}</h3>
            <p>{entry.description}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
